OL,3,GNEWSANursery school 'sad' after four
OL,4,Abreak-ins in month
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nursery school has been left with a
OL,7,F#2,500 repair bill after it was broken
OL,8,Finto four times in a matter of weeks.
OL,10,FPlay equipment was smashed and
OL,11,Fscattered across the grounds of Aclet
OL,12,FClose Nursery School, in Bishop
OL,13,FAuckland, following the latest break-in
OL,14,Fover the weekend.
OL,16,FHead teacher Suzanne Staines said it
OL,17,Fwas happening "with increasing
OL,18,Fregularity", with the four break-ins
OL,19,Fhaving taken place since the start of
OL,20,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
