OL,3,GNEWSANursery school 'sad' after four
OL,4,Abreak-ins in month
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The damage and vandalism is taking
OL,7,Fresources away from our children and
OL,8,Fmeans they are missing out on the
OL,9,Fvaluable learning experiences which we
OL,10,Fwork so hard to provide," she said.
